{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590890/extras/First.jpg?t=1743018175\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GIRL.EXE.EXE</strong> is a psychological horror-puzzle game with unique gameplay and a twisted story where reality blends with code, and bugs become part of the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590890/extras/GirlScaryBall.gif?t=1743018175\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Going back is hard, isn\u2019t it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You return to an abandoned project\u2014a game you once wanted to finish but never could. Now, it has a will of its own. The world is falling apart, rooms are distorting, and the girl trapped inside doesn\u2019t want to let you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590890/extras/Second.png?t=1743018175\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore broken levels, fix bugs, and avoid the traps set by the game itself.</strong> But be careful\u2014if you fix the right room or leave the wrong one broken, you\u2019ll slowly lose your mind. Your once-safe space may turn into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590890/extras/Home.gif?t=1743018175\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Rules:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has <strong>5 locations</strong>, just like the <strong>5 stages of grief</strong>: Denial, Anger, Bargaining, Depression, and Acceptance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590890/extras/Third.png?t=1743018175\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To complete a chapter, you must pass through <strong>5 &quot;correct&quot; rooms</strong>. Encounter a broken room? Return to your computer and <strong>fix the bug</strong>. Make a mistake, and you\u2019ll face <strong>a punishment room</strong> with a challenging trap. Fail to escape, and you\u2019ll start over\u2014while your <strong>mental state deteriorates</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590890/extras/Fourth.png?t=1743018175\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udda5 <strong>Unique Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Modify code, rewrite reality, and escape paradoxes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc41 <strong>Distorted Locations</strong> \u2013 Every room is filled with surprises, anomalies, and echoes of the past</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfad <strong>Mannequins &amp; Glitches</strong> \u2013 Some are just errors\u2026 others are watching you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Punishments for Mistakes</strong> \u2013 A wrong move traps you in a deadly room</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udda4 <strong>A Story of Acceptance</strong> \u2013 The game ends only when you\u2019re ready to let go</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude02 <strong>Dark Humor &amp; Absurdity</strong> \u2013 Not all bugs are terrifying\u2026 some are just ridiculous</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf99 <strong>Atmospheric Voiceovers</strong> \u2013 Hear the girl\u2019s teasing, eerie whispers, and playful threats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590890/extras/Doggo.gif?t=1743018175\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must go through all <strong>5 stages of grief</strong> to complete the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Finish the game. FINISH THE GAME!</strong><br>\u2026Or stay here forever.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590890?t=1743018175","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590890?t=1743018175","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590890/4c328db3c7dd7a53e730bd3683a6a8e76bb2d5c4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743018175","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590890/4c328db3c7dd7a53e730bd3683a6a8e76bb2d5c4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743018175","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590890/extras/First.jpg?t=1743018175\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GIRL.EXE.EXE</strong> is a psychological horror-puzzle game with unique gameplay and a twisted story where reality blends with code, and bugs become part of the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590890/extras/GirlScaryBall.gif?t=1743018175\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Going back is hard, isn\u2019t it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You return to an abandoned project\u2014a game you once wanted to finish but never could. Now, it has a will of its own. The world is falling apart, rooms are distorting, and the girl trapped inside doesn\u2019t want to let you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590890/extras/Second.png?t=1743018175\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore broken levels, fix bugs, and avoid the 