ragraph\">\ud83d\udda4 <strong>A Story of Acceptance</strong> \u2013 The game ends only when you\u2019re ready to let go</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude02 <strong>Dark Humor &amp; Absurdity</strong> \u2013 Not all bugs are terrifying\u2026 some are just ridiculous</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf99 <strong>Atmospheric Voiceovers</strong> \u2013 Hear the girl\u2019s teasing, eerie whispers, and playful threats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590890/extras/Doggo.gif?t=1743018175\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must go through all <strong>5 stages of grief</strong> to complete the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Finish the game. FINISH THE GAME!</strong><br>\u2026Or stay here forever.</p>","developers":["Dymchick1"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590890/8994cdba80881786749a61ee9cdcb3e5953e9685/header.jpg?t=1743018175","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257113128,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113128/movie480.mp4?t=1742232312","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113128/movie_max.mp4?t=1742232312"},"name":"Trailer_1_RU","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257113128/091026c7b46068e560c50e9f97e7f202c9c18ef6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742232312","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25